<title>USA: Weirton Steel, guard union contract ratified.</title>
<headline>Weirton Steel, guard union contract ratified.</headline>
<dateline>WEIRTON, W.Va. 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weirton Steel Corp said Friday that a 56-month labor contract with the Independent Guard Union has been ratified by the memebers.</p>
<p>The union members members provide security for the company.</p>
<p>The contract is the final pact to be ratified this year among Weirton and its four bargaining units.</p>
</text>
